        "title": "9T50 Surge or Shudder Requires a Transmission Glycol Test",
        "description": "GM bulletin 18-NA-378 covers the 2019 XT4 with the 2.0L LSY engine and 9T50 transmission RPO M3H when the vehicle surges, chuggles, fishbites or shudders. GM identifies possible glycol contamination from the stack-plate heat exchanger and requires a fluid-condition check and glycol test before choosing a repair.",
